  "body": "Stacked on #2149 (merge #2149 first)\n\n## What changed\n\n3D Pocket now cuts a 3 mm blind hole at its floor with a 4 mm stepdown.\nThe level planner adds flat floors inside the first depth interval.\nIt keeps stock allowance and the existing material, entry, shell, mask and protected-area checks.\nIt refuses excessive floor levels by name.\n\nThis fix changes four motion files and one decision record.\nThe stack also contains the parent PR changes.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe regular depth ladder used levels -4, -8, -12 and -15 for the test hole.\nIt missed the floor at -3.\nThe material checks correctly refused every lower level because solid material stood above it.\n\n## Tests\n\nNew pins in `crates/motion/tests/blind_floor.rs`:\n\n- `a_blind_hole_shallower_than_one_stepdown_is_cut_at_its_floor`\n- `a_shallow_floor_keeps_stock_allowance_and_the_top_stock_level`\n- `excessive_shallow_floor_levels_are_refused_by_name`\n\nThe first pin failed on unchanged production code with `Empty(\"nothing to cut: the model fills the pocket at every level\")`.\nBoth plain and offset-shell paths now cut one level at Z -3.\nThe independent no-gouge check and the verify check pass.\nThe existing matrix keeps its no-gouge assertions unchanged and now cuts all 1152 cases.\n\nMutation checks restored the four original `cut_levels_under` expressions from `upstream/main`.\nThe checks kept the parent PR wrapper signatures because the complete upstream file has different signatures.\nAll three new pins failed with the old expressions.\nAll five blind-floor tests passed after restoration.\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 611 steps passed, zero failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\n\nThe checks ran with the inherited `sccache` wrapper disabled because it stalled before compilation.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nThis fix changes no `.nc` or `.cl` files relative to parent `e11845b0c`.\nThe required direct comparison with `upstream/main` shows two inherited differences:\n\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/tormach-lathe/thread_g76_inch.nc`: the parent has `J0.0314`; upstream has `J0.0315`.\n- `examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.nc`: the parent predates this upstream example.\n\nBoth differences already exist in `base-2149`.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe release gate, ignored heavy tests and physical machining were not run.\nFloor discovery covers exactly flat upward faces.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #2149 changes `run_plain_with`, `pocket3d_air_split` and `run_rest_with` in `machining3d/entry.rs`.\nThis branch starts at its tested head `e11845b0c741207e747510d1f221f0dc47aa698f`.\nThe parent advanced to `39e6c84e87cb22fcbc4499bd8630741a38024cc1` during this gate.\nMerge #2149 first, then refresh this branch and run its checks again.\nThe stack has one level.\n\nEffort: high\nProcess change: yes\nThe process change belongs to parent #2149.\nChangelog: Cut shallow flat blind floors in 3D Pocket when the stepdown exceeds the hole depth.\nFixes #2088\n",
